# Artifacts generated when the tutorial is run.
#
# SWE ladder (notebooks 08-14):
/build/
/CMakeLists.txt
/swe_step.cpython-*.so
/swe_step_fast.cpp
/timings.json
/machine.json

# Kernel, asynchrony, and MPI notebooks (03-06): %%writefile scripts,
# MPI results, Nsight profiler reports, the downloaded corpus, and plots.
# Patterns are applied at this course root and under solutions/, since
# executing the solution notebooks (e.g. in CI) writes the same artifacts there.
/*.py
/solutions/*.py
!/swe_core.py
!/solutions/swe_core.py
/*.nsys-rep
/solutions/*.nsys-rep
/*.sqlite
/solutions/*.sqlite
/*.ncu-rep
/solutions/*.ncu-rep
/*.qdstrm
/solutions/*.qdstrm
/books__15m.txt
/solutions/books__15m.txt
/test.png
/solutions/test.png

# MPI notebook (06): verified field saved for the notebook visualization.
/heat_equation_result.npz
/solutions/heat_equation_result.npz

# Generated C/C++ from %%writefile cells (nanobind / cffi / cppjit / interop
# exercises). The checked-in tutorial source is re-included below.
/*.c
/*.cpp
/*.cxx
/*.hpp
/*.hxx
/solutions/*.c
/solutions/*.cpp
/solutions/*.cxx
/solutions/*.hpp
/solutions/*.hxx
!/swe_step.cpp
!/swe_cub_solver.cpp
!/swe_raw_cuda_solver.cpp
!/solutions/swe_step.cpp
!/solutions/swe_cub_solver.cpp
!/solutions/swe_raw_cuda_solver.cpp

__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
*.log
